stimulus.description:
A student is writing a class RunTools with two static methods that work with runs of equal characters.
```java
public class RunTools {
    /** Returns the number of positions i such that s.charAt(i) equals s.charAt(i + 1). */
    public static int countPairs(String s) { /* part (a) */ }

    /** Returns s with every run of consecutive equal characters replaced by one copy of that character. */
    public static String squeeze(String s) { /* part (b) */ }
}
```

parts.model_answer:
One correct implementation (ALTON reference answer):
```java
    public static int countPairs(String s) {
        int count = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length() - 1; i++) {
            if (s.charAt(i) == s.charAt(i + 1)) {
                count++;
            }
        }
        return count;
    }
```

One correct implementation (ALTON reference answer):
```java
    public static String squeeze(String s) {
        String result = "";
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
            if (i == 0 || s.charAt(i) != s.charAt(i - 1)) {
                result += s.charAt(i);
            }
        }
        return result;
    }
```

