stimulus.description:
A scoring program tracks a game between a home team and an away team. The target for this game is 21 points. Write the Scoreboard class described below.
```java
public class Scoreboard {
    // to be written in this question:
    //   constructor Scoreboard(int target)
    //   void scoreHome(int points)
    //   void scoreAway(int points)
    //   String leader()
    //   boolean isOver()
}
```

parts.model_answer:
One correct implementation (ALTON reference answer):
```java
public class Scoreboard {
    private int target;
    private int home;
    private int away;

    public Scoreboard(int target) {
        this.target = target;
        home = 0;
        away = 0;
    }
    public void scoreHome(int points) {
        home += points;
    }
    public void scoreAway(int points) {
        away += points;
    }
    public String leader() {
        if (home > away) {
            return "home";
        }
        if (away > home) {
            return "away";
        }
        return "tie";
    }
    public boolean isOver() {
        return home >= target || away >= target;
    }
}
```

